   "title": "Prompt",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Create an original sophisticated seamless repeating geometric pattern inspired by classical decorative geometry. Elegant interlocking arches, stylized fan-shaped elements, rhythmic curves, refined symmetrical ornamentation, precise geometric construction. Deep emerald green, warm ivory, muted jade, and subtle antique-brass color accents. Perfectly balanced motif distribution, consistent decorative line thickness, clean edges, excellent visual rhythm, harmonious spacing. Premium decorative surface design suitable for wallpaper, luxury packaging, textile printing, and stationery. Flat two-dimensional artwork, no perspective, no shadows, no photographic objects, no fabric mockup. Design the geometric elements to connect continuously across all four tile boundaries. Original ornament design, no recognizable branded patterns, no typography, no logos, no watermarks. Square format."
   ]
